# Node.js via nvm

This project requires **Node.js 22** (see `.nvmrc`).

Before running any Node.js, pnpm, or build command in the terminal, activate the correct version:

```bash
source scripts/ensure-node.sh
```

Or inline:

```bash
export NVM_DIR="${NVM_DIR:-$HOME/.nvm}" && . "$NVM_DIR/nvm.sh" && nvm use
```

When chaining commands, prefix the full chain:

```bash
source scripts/ensure-node.sh && pnpm install
source scripts/ensure-node.sh && pnpm run compile
source scripts/ensure-node.sh && pnpm run package
```

Do not use the system default Node if it is not v22. If `nvm use` fails, run `nvm install` first.
